This accesses `name[i + 1]`. The check at line 134 (`if ((i + 1) >= size) break`) is supposed to prevent reading past the buffer. But this check is ONLY in the `else` branch (the branch where `name[i] >= 0x80` or `!isprint(name[i])`).

